91831279_1066624539517455_3291214658421185328_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S0P2gWDxYt4Q7kNvwFeJMwX&_nc_oc=Adp7OfRuje2XUvOBZPyMD301sI17kJhsX5QEt393K01OcANxvIf-kr6a4h6hL84Ezis&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPRyzafC5dkiXLOLQdqcBIYSz57jVRcmJI50cuET5WvXA&oe=6ACBA36E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "1490403593145989", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604385997_1490403596479322_4217599201818206878_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e_yqc2UaveYQ7kNvwG2PqtW&_nc_oc=AdoB4ZKOO6uJUcAhKC37CkjBD3jXldytz22CSFOyAkpLJTwKwQtZ2GaEmVqrS1okGeM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM3CMzthUAGH98tYTCsdUkuI8tSKACY-iITjR6ZpAKuIw&oe=6ACBAE20"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ClickClack_Store_2560x1440.png", "id": "995045572841797", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307443_995045576175130_2666890995825443971_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UbFc8YtzF3cQ7kNvwGVnq92&_nc_oc=Adp4aHiRQu-SjkVUP6KSmleLytAmD9PggGqhBoIMgSwo_mOB8oSuGB4fKSTm-gebI1g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNMK906mw4A60KE1E0vIV_zpv2TGSA5GTSaIaqt0akorg&oe=6ACBA149"}, "display_name": "Click Clack Mixed Reality", "keywords": ["fps", "tactical", "mixedreality", "shooter"], "long_description": "CLICK CLACK MIXED REALITY\n\nThe only adult mixed reality FPS on Quest. Your home. Real weapons. Digital blood on your walls. No mercy.\n\nNo pew pew lasers and cartoon portals. Click Clack MR brings brutal, tactical combat into your actual living space \u2014 walls, hallways, furniture and all. The enemy is in your house. Now bring a friend, or build the house yourself.\n\nThis is Mixed Reality built for people who don't want easy.\n\n\ud83d\udd2b Tactical Breach & Clear \u2014 Stack up on real doors, sweep real rooms, neutralize threats hiding behind your actual couch.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Hostage Rescue \u2014 Breach, identify, and execute under pressure. Some enemies blend in. Make the wrong call and face the consequences.\n\n\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Imposter \u2014 Hostages and killers wear the same face. Search them, read them, decide fast. Hesitate and it's done.\n\n\ud83d\udca3 Bomb Defusal \u2014 Find it, clear the room around it, and defuse it while they keep coming.\n\n\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Kill the Creeper \u2014 One target. He's somewhere in your house. Hunt him down before he finds you.\n\n\ud83d\udc80 Shoot-Out Survival \u2014 Endless wave mode. No respawn timers. No hand-holding. Be the last one standing or start over.\n\n\ud83e\udd1d 2-Player Co-op \u2014 Same room, same fight. Two headsets, one house. Cover each other, or don't. Dead players stay dead until the round ends.\n\n\ud83e\uddf1 Map Builder \u2014 Draw walls, floors and cover with your hands. Drop in 70+ props, from sandbags to shipping containers. Build inside your scan, or take over any open space. Three save slots. Play them solo or co-op. Enemies see your walls,", "short_description": "CLICK CLACK MIXED REALITY\n\nThe only adult mixed reality FPS on Quest. Your home. Real weapons. Digital blood on your walls. No mercy.\n\nNo pew pew lasers and cartoon portals. Click Clack MR brings brutal, tactical combat into your actual living space \u2014 walls, hallways, furniture and all. The enemy is in your house. Now bring a friend, or build the house yourself.\n\nThis is Mixed Reality built for people who don't want easy. Now with co-location based co-op and PvP and Custom Map Builder!\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://ClickClackMR.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lopes Media LLC", "support_website_url": "http://ClickClackMR.com/", "website_url": "http://ClickClackMR.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "con